{"id":50023,"date":"2026-03-19T09:25:47","date_gmt":"2026-03-19T08:25:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50023"},"modified":"2026-09-20T12:24:30","modified_gmt":"2026-09-20T11:24:30","slug":"trail-monges-de-cister","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-monges-de-cister\/","title":{"rendered":"VI Trail Monges de Cister 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">VI Trail Monges de Cister 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>VI Trail Monges de Cister 2026<\/strong> realiza-se a 18 de outubro no concelho hist\u00f3rico de <strong>Alcoba\u00e7a<\/strong>, organizado pelos <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Alcoba\u00e7a<\/strong>. Com ponto de encontro no quartel dos soldados da paz e partida simb\u00f3lica junto ao imponente <strong>Mosteiro de Alcoba\u00e7a<\/strong>, esta 6\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o combina a supera\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva em trilhos naturais com uma nobre miss\u00e3o de angaria\u00e7\u00e3o de fundos em prol da corpora\u00e7\u00e3o local.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa integra o competitivo <strong>Trail Curto de 15 km<\/strong> em piso acidentado e trilhos florestais com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, uma apraz\u00edvel <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> para amantes do ar livre e as concorridas provas <strong>Monges Kids<\/strong> dedicadas \u00e0s camadas jovens. Cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o d\u00e1 direito a refei\u00e7\u00e3o ligeira conv\u00edvio, dorsal personalizado com chip, seguro desportivo, balne\u00e1rios e a exclusiva medalha de finalista alusiva aos monges cistercienses.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">18 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; w